	(text_box "Project: EMBER -- Senior Capstone Design\n\nBoard: Communications Subsystem, Single PCB\n\nDesigner: Nick Grabbs / KI5YNG\n\nRevision: 0.5\nDate: 05/20/2026\n\nRepository: ember/hardware/comms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 28.905 0)
		(size -139.7 37.135)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31542158-3664-4ad1-9290-4f26426c0682")
	)
	(text_box "| Sheet | Title | Contents |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| 1 | Overview | This sheet — block diagram, design notes |\n| 2 | Clock Gen | Si5351A, 25 MHz crystal, I2C, clock outputs |\n| 3 | TX Chain | XOR modulator, tripler, BPF, ADL5602 MMIC |\n| 4 | RX Chain | PSA4 LNA, LO LPF, ADE-1+ mixer, IF term, Sallen-Key LPF, MCP6022 gain |\n| 5 | Digital Control | RP2040 (Pico module), GPIOs, USB |\n| 6 | Power | Distribution, protection, bypass |\n| 7 | Connectors | CSKB H1 + H2 bus, SMA ports, test points |"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.29 228.6 0)
		(size -142.24 40.64)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3934ce7e-e94c-4da6-95c7-9f8de098675a")
	)
	(text_box "\n * 74LVC1G86 XOR Modulator\n    ( BPSK @ 145.67 MHz )\n                    |\n * 2SC3356 Freq Tripler\n    ( 145.67 -> 437 MHz )\n                    |\n * 437 MHz BPF ( pre-MMIC )\n                    |\n * ADL5602 MMIC ( +20 dB )\n                    |\n * 437 MHz BPF ( output )\n                    |\n * TX SMA -> 437 MHz antenna"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 217.17 116.84 0)
		(size -50.8 55.88)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 0 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "495f58b4-36e7-4a91-a75c-52f39ac7fab6")
	)
	(text_box "\n * +3V3, +5V, GND\n * I2C_SCL/SDA\n * VBAT (monitor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 25.4 0)
		(size -33.02 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 0 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "515f980c-dd37-4ad0-8719-bb7d1a076164")
	)
	(text_box "| Rail | Source | Voltage | Consumers |\n|------|--------|---------|-----------|\n| +3V3 | EPS via CSKB (H2.27/28) | 3.3V ±2% | RP2040, Si5351A, 74LVC1G86, MCP6022 |\n| +5V | EPS via CSKB (H2.25/26) | 5.0V ±2% | PSA4-5043+ LNA, ADL5602 MMIC, tripler bias, Pico VSYS |\n| GND | EPS via CSKB (H2.29/30/32, H2.31 AGND) | 0V | All |\n| VBAT | EPS via CSKB (H2.45/46) | 6.0–8.4V | Monitor only (not used for power) |\n\nEstimated current budget:\n+3V3: ~100 mA (RP2040 ~50mA, Si5351A ~30mA, logic ~10mA, op-amp ~10mA)\n+5V: ~140 mA (PSA4 LNA ~60mA, ADL5602 ~60mA, tripler 5mA, Pico VSYS ~10mA, margin ~5mA)\nTotal: <300 mA — well within EPS TPS62933F capacity (3A per rail). Note: PSA4 LNA bias can be GPIO-gated for RX duty-cycling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.45 182.88 0)
		(size -134.62 60.96)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fcad27f-5e47-4cf0-9389-4142d4e9400f")
	)
	(text_box "1. Power from EPS via CSKB bus — no on-board regulators\n2. BPSK modulation at 145.67 MHz (before tripler) — 74LVC1G86\n    fails at 437 MHz, see overview.md timing analysis\n3. Odd-order frequency multiplication preserves BPSK phase states\n   (3 × 180° = 540° ≡ 180° mod 360°)\n4. Tripler bias 47kΩ — empirically optimized (-7.4 dBm @ 437 MHz)\n5. All RF filter caps must be C0G/NP0 (not X7R)\n6. I2C addresses: Si5351A = 0x60, EPS LTC4162 = 0x68 (no conflict)\n7. Flat schematic design — nets connect by name across sheets\n8. Prototype uses Pico module; bare RP2040 deferred to v2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 86.36 0)
		(size -139.7 38.1)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87086e8f-8b19-4254-81d6-77f6724ec5b2")
	)
	(text_box "\n * Input protection\n * Bulk Bypass\n * Pico VSYS feed"
